<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Social media · Content · Creative ideas</div><h1>Hi. I’m Husaina</h1><p class="hero-copy">I began my journey in teaching to create meaningful connections, but my heart has always been in media. Now diving deep into journalism, I’m blending my communication skills, creativity, and love for storytelling to build content that informs, engages, and inspires.</p><a class="btn" href="#work">View my work →</a><a class="btn" href="#contact">Contact me</a></div><aside class="hero-side"><strong>1.5+ years</strong><p>Professional social media experience, with hands-on experience managing family-business pages separately.</p></aside></div></section>
<section id="about"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">01 / About</div><h2 class="section-title">A little about me.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Social media professional with a passion for communication, creativity and storytelling.</p></div><div class="about-grid"><div class="about-text"><p>I began my journey in teaching to create meaningful connections, but my heart has always been in media. Now diving deep into journalism, I’m blending my communication skills, creativity, and love for storytelling to build content that informs, engages, and inspires.</p></div><div class="about-side"><div class="label">What I enjoy</div><p>Creating content, developing ideas, writing captions, working with creative teams and finding ways to make communication more engaging.</p><div class="label">What I bring</div><p>Collaborative spirit, quick to adapt, effective communication, time management and a tech-savvy approach.</p></div></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><b>1.5+</b><span>Years of professional social media experience</span></div><div class="stat feature"><b>Social Pill</b><span>Working full-time in social media and building meaningful digital communication.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section id="experience" class="wine"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">02 / Experience</div><h2 class="section-title">Professional experience.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">My professional social media experience is separate from the social media work I have handled for family businesses.</p></div><div class="experience">
<article class="role"><div class="date">October 2025, Present</div><div><h3>Social media marketing executive</h3><div class="company">Social Pill<br>Brand: Kokilaben Dhirubhai Ambani Hospital &amp; Medical Research Institute</div><ul><li><strong>Social media strategy &amp; content:</strong> Develop content ideas, write impactful captions, and create pitch decks to define and strengthen brand voice at Social Pill.</li><li><strong>Social media management:</strong> Handle end-to-end content posting and management across Instagram, LinkedIn, Facebook, and YouTube, including customer interaction and order coordination.</li><li><strong>Team &amp; client coordination:</strong> Collaborate with designers, assign tasks, ensure timely delivery of creatives, and manage key accounts of Kokilaben Dhirubhai Ambani Hospital.</li><li><strong>Performance &amp; reporting:</strong> Track growth, analyse engagement, and prepare monthly performance reports to optimize digital strategies.</li></ul></div></article>
<article class="role"><div class="date">April 2025, September 2025</div><div><h3>Social media marketing intern</h3><div class="company">Social Pill<br>Brands: HP Vaahn, Litfest and QTP</div><ul><li><strong>Creative strategy:</strong> Ideated content, wrote engaging captions, and built pitch decks to shape brand voice at Social Pill for brands like LitFest, QTP and HP Vaahn.</li><li><strong>Team &amp; workflow:</strong> Coordinated with designers, assigned tasks, and ensured timely, high-quality creative delivery.</li><li><strong>Social media management:</strong> Managed and published content across Instagram, LinkedIn, Facebook, and YouTube to drive engagement and consistency.</li><li><strong>Analytics &amp; growth:</strong> Tracked performance, prepared monthly reports, and optimized content using data-driven insights.</li><li><strong>Community management:</strong> Engaged with audiences, handled inquiries, and supported order management on social platforms.</li></ul></div></article>
</div></div></section>
<section id="earlier-experience" class="little"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">03 / Earlier experience</div><h2 class="section-title">Teaching &amp; early experience.</h2></div><p class="section-intro">Before moving into social media, my experience in education helped me build communication, creativity, planning and people skills.</p></div><div class="experience">
<article class="role"><div class="date">COVID period</div><div><h3>Started Little Hands</h3><div class="company">Home-based preschool</div><p class="long">During the tough times when COVID struck us all, education for our little ones became tough as virtual learning was encouraged. I decided to take up a challenge and started teaching these little feet at home by taking proper precautions and making sure they do not fall back due to adverse external situations.</p><p class="long">I taught them just like we do in school with appropriate books, activities, worksheets, games and toys. Parents who were stuck found an opportunity with me to enroll their children physically rather than relying on mobile phones and apps.</p><p class="long">Once I started receiving a good response, I even opened up batches for a span of 3-6 months for parents who thought a year would get too long.</p></div></article>
<article class="role"><div class="date">2023, Present</div><div><h3>Toddler homeroom teacher</h3><div class="company">Firstcry Intellitots Preschool</div><ul><li>Prepared and delivered engaging lesson plans.</li><li>Conducted group activities to promote participation and social interaction.</li><li>Designed and implemented activities to promote empathy.</li></ul></div></article>
<article class="role"><div class="date">2019, 2020</div><div><h3>Pre primary teacher</h3><div class="company">RBK International Academy</div><ul><li>Created and implemented lesson plans based on child-led interests and curiosities.</li><li>Evaluated students' academic and social growth and maintained appropriate records.</li></ul></div></article>
<article class="role"><div class="date">2017, 2018</div><div><h3>Primary teacher</h3><div class="company">Wilson High School</div><ul><li>Implemented activities to stimulate student learning.</li><li>Reinforced positive behaviour by encouraging effort and praising accomplishments.</li></ul></div></article>
</div></div></section>
