<div class="campaign-block"><h3>December</h3><p>The campaign was inspired by the hospital's logo, where each dot represents a core pillar of the institution's commitment to healthcare excellence.</p><p>Through a series of social media creatives, we explored the significance behind these dots and connected them to the values that define the hospital compassion, innovation, expertise, patient care, research, and excellence.</p></div>
<div class="campaign-block"><h3>June - 3 campaigns</h3><p><span class="campaign-name">1. Mumbai - The Beauty Of Firsts, Protected By Us</span> - This campaign focused on some of life's most meaningful milestones and how healthcare plays a role in making them possible.</p><p>The idea was built around the concept of "firsts" moments that people cherish and remember forever.</p><p>From a newborn's first cry to a stroke survivor's first word, a patient's first meal after surgery, or their first walk after a knee replacement, every milestone represents hope, recovery, and a new beginning.</p>
<p><span class="campaign-name">2. Navi Mumbai - Because in a crisis, the bridge is too far</span> - This campaign was built around a simple but powerful insight: during a medical emergency, distance matters.</p><p>For residents of Navi Mumbai, reaching Mumbai during peak traffic can be challenging when every minute counts.</p><p>The campaign highlighted how Kokilaben Dhirubhai Ambani Hospital, Navi Mumbai brings advanced healthcare closer to patients without requiring them to travel across the city.</p><p>The communication focused on showcasing world-class infrastructure, advanced technology, expert doctors, and comprehensive care available within Navi Mumbai itself.</p>
<p><span class="campaign-name">3. Indore - वही भरोसेका हाथ। अब इंदौर के साथ।</span> This campaign was designed to introduce Kokilaben Dhirubhai Ambani Hospital's presence in Indore while carrying forward the trust associated with the Mumbai institution.</p><p>The central idea was simple: the same expertise, trust, and commitment to patient care that people associate with Mumbai is now available in Indore.</p><p>A key highlight of the campaign was communicating that patients in Indore now have access to consultations from experienced doctors associated with Kokilaben Dhirubhai Ambani Hospital, Mumbai.</p></div>
